 "description": "<p>Kap Helgoland hytten&nbsp;[625] is a travellers' hut, located in a small cove at Kap Helgoland on the north-western point of Store Koldewey.</p><p>Note: Due to possible damage by polar bears the present condition of the hut is unknown.&nbsp;</p><p>Number in brackets [ ] refer to hut number in Peter Schmidt Mikkelsen: <i>\"</i><a href=\"http://www.xsirius.dk/en/node/88\"><i>North-East Greenland 1908-60. &nbsp;The Trapper Era</i></a><i>\"&nbsp; </i>(2008) published by Scott&nbsp;Polar Research Institute.</p>",
